
  EPA STORM WATER MANAGEMENT MODEL - VERSION 5.2 (Build 5.2.4)
  PYSWMM TOOLKIT API - VERSION v1.0 (2023-11-27)
  ------------------------------------------------------------

  *MODEL: Sewer catchment model to simulate sewer discharge from Central Fehraltorf to the the treatment plant at ARA Fehraltorf. This model includes the observed transfer flows from RUMLIKON at location 'f02' (node 555) and RUSSIKON at location 'f03' (node 11d). The model is not complete and may still contain errors! 
  *TRANSFER FLOWS (f02 & f03): measured (in-)flows at f02 and f03. These observations are included as time series inflows (one *.dat file each transfer flow). 
  *CALIBRATION: Catchment outflow (link Link_2, leading to outfall node ARA_Fehraltorf) corresponds to the ARA inflow monitored by the plant operators (f00_qin_lps_utc0.dat). Some preliminary calibration was done for the period of May 2016 with r02 rain and ARA inflow observations. 
  WARNING 04: minimum elevation drop used for Conduit 142aSW-134RW
  WARNING 04: minimum elevation drop used for Conduit 805i-805b
  WARNING 04: minimum elevation drop used for Conduit HAL119
  WARNING 04: minimum elevation drop used for Conduit L129-150c
  WARNING 04: minimum elevation drop used for Conduit L433-L434
  WARNING 10: crest elevation raised to downstream invert for regulator Link RÜB_Usterstrasse_A
  
